+1.  Initialize the interval boundaries `left` and `right` [S1, unofficial].
+2.  Loop `iter` from 0 to `rec_depth - 1` [S1, unofficial]:
+    a. Compute the midpoint: `mid = (left + right) / 2.0` [S1, unofficial].
